  "translation_changes_since_previous_install": [
    {
      "id": "p06318-d1a781768d22",
      "source": "Forty <b>thousand</b> brothers could not, with all their quantity of love, make up my sum—",
      "source_sha256": "d1a781768d2204f15005b2d443481333aef6673efd31f8a453b5f7a34ba65b6b",
      "previous_target": "四十个<b>千</b>，也就是四万个兄弟，把他们所有的爱加在一起，也抵不过我的爱——",
      "target": "<b>四万</b>个兄弟的爱加在一起，也抵不过我的爱——"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06349-1839ddf4c47b",
      "source": "Do not shy away from the world, as I did. Go into the darkness with strength. Go with purpose.",
      "source_sha256": "1839ddf4c47b815b1484feacaa767017980141b22ab05fbe1c6c13c052d1f834",
      "previous_target": "不要像我一样逃避这个世界。坚强地走进黑暗。带着目标前行。",
      "target": "不要像我那样逃避世界。带着力量向黑暗中前行。带着目标前行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06350-5c7367ee3690",
      "source": "That is all.",
      "source_sha256": "5c7367ee369043f31ab02fb8e0367275cd2a566f7c61324737a830a2478744ee",
      "previous_target": "我要说的就这些。",
      "target": "我要说的就是这些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10431-b4d623ece42b",
      "source": "Of course I do. But why would you consider such a thing?",
